      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've reproed this in a controlled manner.\n1. Prepare two VRC accounts, we'll call them A and B. Make sure they're friends.\n2. Log in with both A and B. On A, log into the vrchat home website as well, then log out of A in the client (leaving VRChat home open).\n3. Wait a bit. A will remain online in B's client, in both online friends and favorites, even after A shows as \"active\" on the website.\n4. Now close the vrchat home website and wait a few minutes. Eventually, as the A user transitions from active to offline, they will disappear from B's online friends, and switch to offline in favorites.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
